    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Winter Heat</i>\u00a0is a narrative game about love in the internet age.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Javiera Vera is a freelancer living in the sweltering summer of Santiago, in Chile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fukkoshi Shio is an office worker living in the snowy rural town of Miyazu, Kyoto, in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two are long-time internet friends, living across the world, across time zones, but with a bond as strong as the fiber optic cables connecting them. How will that bond transform, though, during one special December?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Javi and Shio through their online lives as they grow even closer together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy, fun romance story across continents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear narrative storyline taking place through online chats, video calls, browser MMOs, and social media accounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and narrative storytelling in the form of &quot;apps&quot; on your device--Maps, Gallery, Calendar, Notes, Test Your English, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus sub-game included: Oomfie RPG, a dungeon crawling deckbuilder adventure! A complete standalone experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Winter Heat</i>\u00a0is a narrative game about love in the internet age.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Javiera Vera is a freelancer living in the sweltering summer of Santiago, in Chile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fukkoshi Shio is an office worker living in the snowy rural town of Miyazu, Kyoto, in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two are long-time internet friends, living across the world, across time zones, but with a bond as strong as the fiber optic cables connecting them. How will that bond transform, though, during one special December?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Javi and Shio through their online lives as they grow even closer together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy, fun romance story across continents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear narrative storyline taking place through online chats, video calls, browser MMOs, and social media accounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and narrative storytelling in the form of &quot;apps&quot; on your device--Maps, Gallery, Calendar, Notes, Test Your English, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus sub-game included: Oomfie RPG, a dungeon crawling deckbuilder adventure! A complete standalone experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Javi lives in Santiago, and Shio lives in Kyoto. They're best friends over the internet, until one fateful December brings them even closer together than ever before. A narrative game about long-distance love that takes place over chats, video calls, and social media apps.",
